      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can easily determine which platform you're on using EasyPlatformSwitch. To do this, create three GameObjects: isPC, isAndroid, and isIOS. Then use EasyPlatformSwitch to automatically enable or disable these objects based on the current build platform. In scripts (or the graph), use object.activeSelf to check which platform is currently active.",
